來看，藍白相間的碗具襯托出拉麵的誘人色澤，各種配料有序地擺放在湯麵上，色彩搭配和諧，給人賞心悅目的感覺。\n\n總的來說，這碗拉麵在湯頭、麵條、配料以及擺盤上都表現出色，是一次令人滿意的品嘗體驗，無論是拉麵愛好者還是普通食客，都值得一試，相信它不會讓人失望。",null,[0,49]]]],[null,1778526219000000,1778526219000000,"3 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfOHNmU1YyQmlFdnJlM0hfZlRCTTFfdw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfOHNmU1YyQmlFdnJlM0hfZlRCTTFfdxoTQ2d3SWk5Q0kwQVlRc3BqX21BSQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjrvf_Tw9KWAxX_ka8BHWNQEJQQ_2MIvAEoBg"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10329110332118018904/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc0TVdSSFNUTlNSVnBIWW1zNU1HRXpXa1ZVYm1zMVlURmtkRlZ1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10329110332118018904/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc0TVdSSFNUTlNSVnBIWW1zNU1HRXpXa1ZVYm1zMVlURmtkRlZ1WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10329110332118018904/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc0TVdSSFNUTlNSVnBIWW1zNU1HRXpXa1ZVYm1zMVlURmtkRlZ1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10329110332118018904/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc0TVdSSFNUTlNSVnBIWW1zNU1HRXpXa1ZVYm1zMVlURmtkRlZ1WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10329110332118018904/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc0TVdSSFNUTlNSVnBIWW1zNU1HRXpXa1ZVYm1zMVlURmtkRlZ1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10329110332118018904/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc0TVdSSFNUTlNSVnBIWW1zNU1HRXpXa1ZVYm1zMVlURmtkRlZ1WXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["真心感謝您如此細膩且專業的評論，這讓我們店內的所有夥伴感到無比感動，也讓我們有更大的動力持續為每一位貴賓服務~\n您從湯頭風味、麵條口感到配料層次，都給了我們非常高的肯。男子漢拉麵一直希望在價格與品質之間取得平衡，也努力把每一碗麵的細節做到最好。\n謝謝您的支持與認可，期待未來還能持續帶給您滿意的用餐體驗！",null,[0,152]]]],[null,null,874,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w4MWRHSTNSRVpHYms5MGEzWkVUbms1YTFkdFVuYxAB!2m1!